      "parameters": {
        "content": "## ⏰ Second Brain — Jadwal\nSemua isi pesan disusun server (`/api/public/n8n/digest`, `/api/public/n8n/reminders`) per user yang sudah `/link` Telegram. n8n hanya memicu & mengirim.\n\n| Jadwal (WIB) | Endpoint |\n|---|---|\n| Tiap 15 menit | `POST /reminders` (jatuh tempo ≤ `REMINDER_LEAD_MINUTES`, tandai `reminded`) |\n| 07:00 | `GET /digest?kind=morning` (hari ini + overdue + inbox) |\n| 12:30 Sen–Jum | `GET /digest?kind=overdue` |\n| 20:30 | `GET /digest?kind=evening` (selesai hari ini, besok) |\n| Minggu 18:00 | `GET /digest?kind=weekly` (weekly review) |\n| 03:00 | `POST /maintenance` (recurring, purge trash > 30 hari) |\n\n**Env:** `SECOND_BRAIN_URL`, `TELEGRAM_BOT_TOKEN`, `TELEGRAM_ALLOWED_CHAT_IDS`, `REMINDER_LEAD_MINUTES` (default 60). **Credential:** Header Auth `x-api-key`.",
        "height": 420,
        "width": 640,
        "color": "6"
      },
      "id": "dace0bec-c064-4949-b609-ab469cf97371",
      "name": "Note",
